{"type":"message","id":"0df6ccf0","parentId":"e035b976","timestamp":"2026-02-12T13:18:29.426Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_G8YJEyQZQh2DZMyq57h8JWKW|","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# TODO\n\n## Status\n- A task is being developed. Status checked on [2026-02-12 15:01]. Status checked on [2026-02-12 15:06]. Status checked on [2026-02-12 15:11]. Status checked on [2026-02-12 15:16].\n\n## Current Activity\n- Expanding AI-powered analysis to cover all 17 SEO indicators. Issue: Integrating additional indicators into the backend pipeline (Vercel AI Gateway/OpenRouter). Progress: Automation tests for 50% of indicators.\n\n## Future Enhancements\n- Redesign the UI completely to be modern, beautiful, responsive\n- Make all SEO indicators to include analysis from AI models through OpenRouter\n- Caching for repeated analyses\n- User accounts & history\n- PDF/CSV export\n- Scheduled checks\n- Competitor comparison\n\n## New Tasks Based on Project Insights\n\n### Enhance Core Features\n- Expand AI-powered analysis to all 17 SEO indicators.\n- Optimize prompt design and API configuration for better AI results.\n- Add support for secondary AI provider (OpenRouter) as a fallback.\n- Improve scoring algorithm to provide more detailed insights beyond 1-3 stars.\n\n### Improve User Experience\n- Simplify first-time user flow with a step-by-step tutorial.\n- Highlight differences between static and AI-powered suggestions in the UI.\n- Make analysis results downloadable in user-friendly formats (e.g., PDF/CSV).\n\n### Address Technical Improvements\n- Refactor existing code structure for scalability as features expand.\n- Implement database query optimization for larger websites.\n- Strengthen test coverage for all indicators and automate API limit handling.\n- Resolve the production test issue with `indicator-checks.spec.js` caused by transient API errors.\n\n### Deployment & Testing\n- Migrate to a dependable CI pipeline ensuring seamless deployment.\n- Automate cleanup for `prod-test-results` after fixes are verified in production.\n- Introduce staging environment for pre-prod validation."}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1770902309423}}
