{"type":"message","id":"2f849a54","parentId":"9c115493","timestamp":"2026-02-12T13:18:54.662Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_gfPFABtdHbJy58ZT4QS7dld4|","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"<!doctype html>\r\n<html lang=\"en\" data-bs-theme=\"dark\">\r\n<head>\r\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\r\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\r\n    <title>SEOIndicator.com - AI Powered SEO Analysis</title>\r\n    <meta name=\"description\" content=\"Free AI-powered SEO analysis tool. Get instant scores and suggestions for 17 SEO indicators including title, meta, mobile-friendly, and more.\">\r\n    <link href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.6/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\r\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\r\n    <link rel=\"icon\" href=\"favicon.ico\">\r\n    \r\n    <!-- Google Analytics -->\r\n    <script async src=\"https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtag/js?id=G-RWCSLW7EXF\"></script>\r\n    <script>\r\n        window.dataLayer = window.dataLayer || [];\r\n        function gtag(){dataLayer.push(arguments);}\r\n        gtag('js', new Date());\r\n        gtag('config', 'G-RWCSLW7EXF');\r\n    </script>\r\n</head>\r\n\r\n<body>\r\n    <!-- Contact Email -->\r\n    <div class=\"position-fixed top-0 end-0 p-3\" style=\"z-index: 1050;\">\r\n        <a href=\"mailto:info@SEOIndicator.com\" class=\"text-white text-decoration-none\" \r\n           style=\"transition: color 0.3s ease;\" title=\"Contact us\"\r\n           onmouseover=\"this.style.color='#0d6efd'\" onmouseout=\"this.style.color='white'\">\r\n            info@SEOIndicator.com\r\n        </a>\r\n    </div>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"container\">\r\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\r\n            <div class=\"col-lg-10 col-md-12 text-center\">\r\n                <img src=\"Logo-SEOIndicator-com.png\" alt=\"SEOIndicator.com Logo\" style=\"max-width: 200px; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\r\n                <h1 class=\"mb-4 main-title\">AI Powered SEO Analysis</h1>\r\n\r\n                <!-- Error Messages -->\r\n                <div id=\"error-messages\"></div>\r\n\r\n                <!-- Domain Input Form -->\r\n                <form id=\"seo-form\" class=\"mb-4 seo-input-form\">\r\n                    <div class=\"input-group input-group-lg mb-3\">\r\n                        <input type=\"text\" class=\"form-control\" id=\"domain-input\" \r\n                               placeholder=\"Enter domain name (e.g., google.com)\" \r\n                               aria-label=\"Domain name\" required autocomplete=\"off\">\r\n                        <button class=\"btn btn-primary custom-submit-btn\" type=\"submit\">Analyze!</button>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </form>\r\n\r\n                <!-- Overall Score -->\r\n                <div class=\"overall-score-container mt-4 mb-3\">\r\n                    <h2 id=\"overall-score\">Overall score: ☆☆☆ (0/51)</h2>\r\n                </div>\r\n                \r\n                <!-- Progress Bar -->\r\n                <div class=\"progress-container mt-3 mb-4\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center mb-2\">\r\n                        <small class=\"text-muted\">Analysis Progress</small>\r\n                        <small class=\"text-muted progress-text\">0/17</small>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <div class=\"progress\" style=\"height: 8px;\">\r\n                        <div class=\"progress-bar progress-bar-striped progress-bar-animated\" \r\n                             role=\"progressbar\" style=\"width: 0%\" aria-valuenow=\"0\" \r\n                             aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\"></div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n                \r\n                <!-- Results Table -->\r\n                <div class=\"table-responsive result-container\">\r\n                    <table class=\"table table-bordered table-dark\">\r\n                        <thead>\r\n                            <tr>\r\n                                <th scope=\"col\" style=\"width: 5%;\">Nr.</th>\r\n                                <th scope=\"col\" style=\"width: 15%;\">Indicator</th>\r\n                                <th scope=\"col\" style=\"width: 10%;\">Score</th>\r\n                                <th scope=\"col\" style=\"width: 25%;\">Result</th>\r\n                                <th scope=\"col\" style=\"width: 45%;\">Suggestion</th>\r\n                            </tr>\r\n                        </thead>\r\n                        <tbody class=\"table-group-divider\" id=\"results-tbody\">\r\n                            <!-- Results populated by JavaScript -->\r\n                        </tbody>\r\n                    </table>\r\n                </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.6/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js\"></script>\r\n    <script>\r\n        const INDICATORS = [\r\n            {key: 'url', name: 'URL', guide: 'url'},\r\n            {key: 'title', name: 'Title Tag', guide: 'title-tag'},\r\n            {key: 'meta_description', name: 'Meta Description', guide: 'meta-description'},\r\n            {key: 'robots', name: 'robots.txt', guide: 'robots-txt'},\r\n            {key: 'sitemap', name: 'sitemap.xml', guide: 'sitemap-xml'},\r\n            {key: 'h1', name: 'Headings', guide: 'headings'},\r\n            {key: 'filenames', name: 'Filenames', guide: 'filenames'},\r\n            {key: 'image_alt', name: 'Image Alt', guide: 'image-alt'},\r\n            {key: 'links', name: 'Links', guide: 'links'},\r\n            {key: '404_page', name: '404 Page', guide: '404-page'},\r\n            {key: 'mobile_friendly', name: 'Mobile Friendly', guide: 'mobile-friendly'},\r\n            {key: 'language', name: 'Language', guide: 'language'},\r\n            {key: 'favicon', name: 'Favicon', guide: 'favicon'},\r\n            {key: 'canonical', name: 'Canonical Tag', guide: 'canonical-tag'},\r\n            {key: 'social_meta_tags', name: 'Social Media Meta Tags', guide: 'social-media-meta-tags'},\r\n            {key: 'aria', name: 'ARIA', guide: 'aria'},\r\n            {key: 'page_speed', name: 'Page Speed', guide: 'page-speed'}\r\n        ];\r\n\r\n        function renderStars(score) {\r\n            if (score === null || score === undefined) return '☆☆☆';\r\n            const s = Math.max(0, Math.min(3, Number(score)));\r\n            return '★'.repeat(s) + '☆'.repeat(3 - s);\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        function getRowClass(score) {\r\n            const s = Number(score);\r\n            if (s >= 3) return 'table-success';\r\n            if (s === 2) return 'table-warning';\r\n            return 'table-danger';\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        function initTable() {\r\n            const tbody = document.getElementById('results-tbody');\r\n            tbody.innerHTML = '';\r\n            INDICATORS.forEach((ind, idx) => {\r\n                const row = document.createElement('tr');\r\n                row.setAttribute('data-indicator', ind.key);\r\n                row.innerHTML = `\r\n                    <td>${idx + 1}</td>\r\n                    <td><a href=\"/seo-guides/${ind.guide}\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"${ind.name} SEO Guide\">${ind.name}</a></td>\r\n                    <td class=\"score-cell\">☆☆☆</td>\r\n                    <td class=\"result-cell\">-</td>\r\n                    <td class=\"suggestion-cell\">-</td>\r\n                `;\r\n                tbody.appendChild(row);\r\n            });\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        function updateRow(indicator, result) {\r\n            const row = document.querySelector(`tr[data-indicator=\"${indicator}\"]`);\r\n            if (!row) return;\r\n            \r\n            row.className = result.score !== null ? getRowClass(result.score) : '';\r\n            row.querySelector('.score-cell').textContent = renderStars(result.score);\r\n            row.querySelector('.result-cell').textContent = result.details || '-';\r\n            \r\n            // Format suggestion with line breaks\r\n            const suggestionCell = row.querySelector('.suggestion-cell');\r\n            if (result.suggestion && result.suggestion !== '-') {\r\n                suggestionCell.innerHTML = result.suggestion.replace(/\\n/g, '<br>');\r\n            } else {\r\n                suggestionCell.textContent = '-';\r\n            }\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        function showError(message) {\r\n            const errorDiv = document.getElementById('error-messages');\r\n            errorDiv.innerHTML = `<div class=\"alert alert-danger\" role=\"alert\">${message}</div>`;\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        function startAnalysis(domain) {\r\n            // Clear previous errors\r\n            document.getElementById('error-messages').innerHTML = '';\r\n            \r\n            // Show progress\r\n            const progressContainer = document.querySelector('.progress-container');\r\n            const progressBar = document.querySelector('.progress-bar');\r\n            const progressText = document.querySelector('.progress-text');\r\n            progressContainer.style.display = 'block';\r\n            \r\n            // Initialize table\r\n            initTable();\r\n            \r\n            // Start analysis\r\n            const formData = new FormData();\r\n            formData.append('domain', domain);\r\n            \r\n            // API endpoint (consistent with actual file names)\r\n            const apiEndpoint = 'api/start-analysis.php';\r\n            \r\n            fetch(apiEndpoint, {\r\n                method: 'POST',\r\n                body: formData\r\n            })\r\n            .then(r => r.json())\r\n            .then(data => {\r\n                if (!data.success) {\r\n                    showError(data.message || 'Analysis failed');\r\n                    progressContainer.style.display = 'none';\r\n                    return;\r\n                }\r\n                \r\n                const jobId = data.job_id;\r\n                const analyzedDomain = data.final_url;\r\n                \r\n                // Update header with domain\r\n                document.getElementById('overall-score').innerHTML = \r\n\n[71 more lines in file. Use offset=201 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1770902334659}}
{"type":"message","id":"f4a9b849","parentId":"2f849a54","timestamp":"2026-02-12T13:18:58.470Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Identifying missing multi-indicator analysis function**\n\nNoted that analysis currently handles only two class-based indicators and the function for analyzing all 17 indicators in one call is missing, possibly replaced by a new function in tests; next step is to check the project docs for relevant details.","thinkingSignature":"{\"encrypted_content\":\"\",\"id\":\"\",\"summary\":[{\"text\":\"**Identifying missing multi-indicator analysis function**\\n\\nNoted that analysis currently handles only two class-based indicators and the function for analyzing all 17 indicators in one call is missing, possibly replaced by a new function in tests; next step is to check the project docs for relevant details.\",\"type\":\"summary_text\"}],\"type\":\"reasoning\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_NQq39lY7GThAVK8YeAeJqfFI|","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"C:\\Users\\Raitis\\Desktop\\My WEB projects\\SEOIndicator-com\\Files-SEOIndicator-com\\docs\\PROJECT.md"},"partialJson":"{\"path\":\"C:\\\\Users\\\\Raitis\\\\Desktop\\\\My WEB projects\\\\SEOIndicator-com\\\\Files-SEOIndicator-com\\\\docs\\\\PROJECT.md\"}"}],"api":"openai-responses","provider":"github-copilot","model":"gpt-5.2-codex","usage":{"input":2206,"output":97,"cacheRead":15488,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":17791,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1770902334662}}
{"type":"message","id":"f28968ee","parentId":"f4a9b849","timestamp":"2026-02-12T13:18:58.496Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_NQq39lY7GThAVK8YeAeJqfFI|","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# SEOIndicator.com - Project Documentation\r\n\r\n## Overview\r\nOne-page SEO analysis tool that analyzes 17 SEO indicators using AI-powered suggestions via Vercel AI Gateway. Currently configured to analyze only the URL indicator with AI, while other indicators use static analysis.\r\n\r\n## Core Functionality\r\n1. User enters domain\r\n2. System fetches HTML and extracts SEO data\r\n3. Vercel AI analyzes URL indicator (others use static analysis)\r\n4. Results display progressively with 1-3 star ratings\r\n5. Suggestions show both \"Static Analysis:\" and \"AI:\" sections\r\n\r\n## Technology Stack\r\n- **Frontend:** Bootstrap 5.3.6, vanilla JavaScript\r\n- **Backend:** PHP 8.x with MySQL\r\n- **AI:** Vercel AI Gateway (meituan/longcat-flash-chat) or OpenRouter (switchable)\r\n- **Deployment:** Hostinger shared hosting\r\n- **Testing:** Playwright automated tests\r\n\r\n## Database Schema\r\n\r\n**`jobs`** - Stores analysis jobs\r\n- job_id, session_id, domain, final_url, page_content, created_at, updated_at\r\n\r\n**`job_results`** - Stores indicator results\r\n- job_id, indicator, status, score (1-3), details, suggestion\r\n\r\n**`ip_requests_log`** - Rate limiting (1 req/min per IP)\r\n- ip_address, last_request_time\r\n\r\n**`api_logs`** - API request/response logging\r\n- job_id, provider, model, request_data, response_data, http_code, success, error_message, created_at\r\n\r\n## 17 SEO Indicators\r\n\r\nURL • Title Tag • Meta Description • Robots.txt • Sitemap.xml • Headings (H1) • Filenames • Image Alt • Links • 404 Page • Mobile Friendly • Language • Favicon • Canonical Tag • Social Meta Tags • ARIA • Page Speed\r\n\r\n## API Endpoints\r\n\r\n**`api/start-analysis`** (POST) - Production\r\n**`api/start-analysis.php`** (POST) - Localhost\r\n- Input: `domain`\r\n- Process: Fetch HTML → Extract all SEO data → Vercel AI analyzes URL → Static analysis for others → Store results\r\n- Output: `{success, job_id, final_url}`\r\n\r\n**`api/job-progress`** (GET) - Production  \r\n**`api/job-progress.php`** (GET) - Localhost\r\n- Input: `job_id`\r\n- Output: `{success, progress: {done, total}, results: {...}, overall: {achieved, possible}}`\r\n\r\n**Note**: JavaScript automatically detects environment and uses appropriate endpoint (.php for localhost, no extension for production)\r\n\r\n**`view-api-logs.php`** (GET)\r\n- View all API requests/responses with full details (for debugging)\r\n\r\n## Scoring\r\n- 1-3 stars per indicator (Red=1, Yellow=2, Green=3)\r\n- Overall: Sum of all scores / max possible (51)\r\n\r\n## File Structure\r\n```\r\nFiles-SEOIndicator-com/\r\n├── index.php              # Main UI\r\n├── seo_logic.php          # Analysis logic\r\n├── style.css              # Dark theme\r\n├── config.php             # API keys (gitignored)\r\n├── db_config.php          # DB config (gitignored)\r\n├── api/\r\n│   ├── start-analysis.php\r\n│   └── job-progress.php\r\n├── database/migrations/   # SQL migrations\r\n├── seo-guides/            # 17 guide pages\r\n├── tests/                 # Playwright tests\r\n└── docs/                  # Documentation\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Configuration\r\n\r\n**config.php:**\r\n```php\r\n// Switch between 'vercel' or 'openrouter'\r\ndefine('AI_PROVIDER', 'vercel');\r\n\r\n// Vercel AI Gateway\r\ndefine('VERCEL_AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY', 'vck_...');\r\ndefine('VERCEL_AI_MODEL', 'meituan/longcat-flash-chat');\r\n\r\n// OpenRouter (alternative)\r\ndefine('OPENROUTER_API_KEY', 'sk-or-v1-...');\r\ndefine('OPENROUTER_MODEL', 'deepseek/deepseek-chat-v3-0324:free');\r\n\r\n// Other APIs\r\ndefine('GOOGLE_PAGESPEED_API_KEY', 'AIza...');\r\n```\r\n\r\n**db_config.php:**\r\n```php\r\ndefine('DB_HOST', 'localhost');\r\ndefine('DB_USER', 'root');\r\ndefine('DB_PASS', 'password');\r\ndefine('DB_NAME', 'seo');\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Deployment\r\n\r\n**Local:**\r\n1. Start XAMPP (Apache + MySQL)\r\n2. Run migrations: `php database/migrate.php migrate`\r\n3. Create `config.php` and `db_config.php`\r\n4. Access: `http://localhost/`\r\n\r\n**Production (Hostinger):**\r\n1. Push to GitHub main\r\n2. GitHub Actions auto-deploys via FTP\r\n3. Runs Playwright tests\r\n4. Logs to `prod-test-results/`\r\n\r\n**Testing:**\r\n- Local: `npm test`\r\n- Production: `npm run test:production`\r\n\r\n## Rate Limiting\r\n1 request/minute per IP (bypassed for localhost)\r\n\r\n## AI Integration\r\n\r\n**Providers:**\r\n- **Vercel AI Gateway** (default) - Uses meituan/longcat-flash-chat model\r\n- **OpenRouter** (alternative) - Uses free deepseek model\r\n- Switch between providers by changing `AI_PROVIDER` in config.php\r\n\r\n**Current AI Integration:**\r\n- Extract all 17 indicators from HTML\r\n- AI analyzes only URL indicator (others commented out for future expansion)\r\n- Build prompt with URL data only\r\n- One AI API call analyzes URL indicator\r\n- Parse JSON response and merge with static analysis\r\n- Suggestions display as \"Static Analysis:\" and \"AI:\" sections\r\n\r\n**Benefits:**\r\n- Focused AI analysis on specific indicators\r\n- Clear separation of static vs AI analysis\r\n- Lower costs (analyzing only needed indicators)\r\n- Easy to expand to more indicators\r\n- Provider flexibility\r\n\r\n## Security\r\n- API keys gitignored\r\n- SQL prepared statements\r\n- Session-based isolation\r\n- Rate limiting\r\n\r\n## Performance\r\n- Single AI API call for URL indicator\r\n- Database-backed storage\r\n- Progressive UI updates\r\n- Minimal dependencies\r\n- Static analysis for non-AI indicators\r\n\r\n## Testing\r\n- **indicator-checks.spec.js** - Tests URL indicator with AI response\r\n  - Focuses specifically on URL indicator analysis\r\n  - Verifies AI response contains \"Static Analysis:\" and \"AI:\" sections\r\n  - Ensures URL indicator suggestion is not empty or fallback text\r\n\r\n\r\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1770902338493}}
{"type":"message","id":"379c46aa","parentId":"f28968ee","timestamp":"2026-02-12T13:19:04.773Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Investigating AI analysis coverage**\n\nI'm checking seo_logic.php for existing partial AI analysis limited to two classes and looking into older scripts in seo-guides and start-analysis for static analysis of all 17 indicators; searching for relevant functions or keywords like \"Static Analysis\" or \"AI:\" to locate any missing implementations.","thinkingSignature":"{\"encrypted_content\":\"\",\"id\":\"\",\"summary\":[{\"text\":\"**Investigating AI analysis coverage**\\n\\nI'm checking seo_logic.php for existing partial AI analysis limited to two classes and looking into older scripts in seo-guides and start-analysis for static analysis of all 17 indicators; searching for relevant functions or keywords like \\\"Static Analysis\\\" or \\\"AI:\\\" to locate any missing implementations.\",\"type\":\"summary_text\"}],\"type\":\"reasoning\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_p2SRNdXk8DJGv7ga2s3ivxNj|","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"Get-ChildItem -Recurse -File -Path . | Select-String -Pattern \"Static Analysis|AI:\"","workdir":"C:\\Users\\Raitis\\Desktop\\My WEB projects\\SEOIndicator-com\\Files-SEOIndicator-com\\"},"partialJson":"{\"command\":\"Get-ChildItem -Recurse -File -Path . | Select-String -Pattern \\\"Static Analysis|AI:\\\"\",\"workdir\":\"C:\\\\Users\\\\Raitis\\\\Desktop\\\\My WEB projects\\\\SEOIndicator-com\\\\Files-SEOIndicator-com\\\\\"}"}],"api":"openai-responses","provider":"github-copilot","model":"gpt-5.2-codex","usage":{"input":1491,"output":166,"cacheRead":17664,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":19321,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1770902338496}}
