{"type":"message","id":"27e91be9","parentId":"cd2976ab","timestamp":"2026-02-12T13:19:19.499Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Planning AI analysis integration**\n\nI'm focusing on inspecting existing static analysis functions in old scripts to map data for the AI prompt and checking for a potential job-progress endpoint in api/job-progress.php to guide the subagent's next actions.","thinkingSignature":"{\"encrypted_content\":\"\",\"id\":\"\",\"summary\":[{\"text\":\"**Planning AI analysis integration**\\n\\nI'm focusing on inspecting existing static analysis functions in old scripts to map data for the AI prompt and checking for a potential job-progress endpoint in api/job-progress.php to guide the subagent's next actions.\",\"type\":\"summary_text\"}],\"type\":\"reasoning\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_hUe0IrVXqKTl8Z6W8PyaM3lD|","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"C:\\Users\\Raitis\\Desktop\\My WEB projects\\SEOIndicator-com\\Files-SEOIndicator-com\\api\\job-progress.php","offset":1,"limit":200},"partialJson":"{\"path\":\"C:\\\\Users\\\\Raitis\\\\Desktop\\\\My WEB projects\\\\SEOIndicator-com\\\\Files-SEOIndicator-com\\\\api\\\\job-progress.php\",\"offset\":1,\"limit\":200}"}],"api":"openai-responses","provider":"github-copilot","model":"gpt-5.2-codex","usage":{"input":11032,"output":113,"cacheRead":56960,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":68105,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1770902355550}}
{"type":"message","id":"8ed4ffdc","parentId":"27e91be9","timestamp":"2026-02-12T13:19:19.524Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_hUe0IrVXqKTl8Z6W8PyaM3lD|","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"<?php\nsession_start();\nheader('Content-Type: application/json');\n\nrequire_once __DIR__ . '/../db_config.php';\n\nfunction json_error($message, $code = 400) {\n    http_response_code($code);\n    echo json_encode(['success' => false, 'message' => $message]);\n    exit;\n}\n\nif ($_SERVER['REQUEST_METHOD'] !== 'GET') {\n    json_error('Method not allowed', 405);\n}\n\n$job_id = trim($_GET['job_id'] ?? '');\nif ($job_id === '') {\n    json_error('job_id is required');\n}\n\n$conn = new mysqli(DB_HOST, DB_USER, DB_PASS, DB_NAME);\nif ($conn->connect_errno) {\n    json_error('Database connection failed', 500);\n}\n$conn->set_charset('utf8mb4');\n\n// Get job info\n$stmt = $conn->prepare(\"SELECT session_id FROM jobs WHERE job_id=?\");\nif (!$stmt) {\n    $conn->close();\n    json_error('Job not found', 404);\n}\n$stmt->bind_param('s', $job_id);\n$stmt->execute();\n$res = $stmt->get_result();\nif (!$res || $res->num_rows === 0) {\n    $stmt->close();\n    $conn->close();\n    json_error('Job not found', 404);\n}\n$job = $res->fetch_assoc();\n$stmt->close();\n\n// Verify session\nif ($job['session_id'] !== session_id()) {\n    $conn->close();\n    json_error('Forbidden', 403);\n}\n\n// Get results\n$results = [];\n$done = 0;\n$total = 0;\n$achieved = 0;\n$possible = 0;\n\n$q = $conn->prepare(\"SELECT indicator, status, score, details, suggestion FROM job_results WHERE job_id=?\");\nif ($q) {\n    $q->bind_param('s', $job_id);\n    $q->execute();\n    $rs = $q->get_result();\n    while ($row = $rs->fetch_assoc()) {\n        $results[$row['indicator']] = [\n            'status' => $row['status'],\n            'score' => is_null($row['score']) ? null : (int)$row['score'],\n            'details' => $row['details'],\n            'suggestion' => $row['suggestion']\n        ];\n        $total++;\n        if ($row['status'] === 'done') {\n            $done++;\n            if (is_numeric($row['score'])) {\n                $achieved += (int)$row['score'];\n            }\n            $possible += 3;\n        }\n    }\n    $q->close();\n}\n\n$conn->close();\n\necho json_encode([\n    'success' => true,\n    'job_id' => $job_id,\n    'results' => $results,\n    'progress' => ['done' => $done, 'total' => $total],\n    'overall' => ['achieved' => $achieved, 'possible' => $possible]\n]);\nexit;\n?>\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1770902359522}}
{"type":"message","id":"e6048ba0","parentId":"8ed4ffdc","timestamp":"2026-02-12T13:19:24.859Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Investigating indicator analysis functions**\n\nNo static analysis functions found so far; dynamic results likely come from job-related tables and start-analysis writing to the database. Next, I'll inspect the seo-guides Indicator classes and check for TODOs or pipeline info to clarify the data structure and analysis flow.","thinkingSignature":"{\"encrypted_content\":\"\",\"id\":\"\",\"summary\":[{\"text\":\"**Investigating indicator analysis functions**\\n\\nNo static analysis functions found so far; dynamic results likely come from job-related tables and start-analysis writing to the database. Next, I'll inspect the seo-guides Indicator classes and check for TODOs or pipeline info to clarify the data structure and analysis flow.\",\"type\":\"summary_text\"}],\"type\":\"reasoning\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_2rBRO4qecms9JfgMNSEPSQN7|","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"C:\\Users\\Raitis\\Desktop\\My WEB projects\\SEOIndicator-com\\Files-SEOIndicator-com\\seo-guides\\Indicator.php"},"partialJson":"{\"path\":\"C:\\\\Users\\\\Raitis\\\\Desktop\\\\My WEB projects\\\\SEOIndicator-com\\\\Files-SEOIndicator-com\\\\seo-guides\\\\Indicator.php\"}"}],"api":"openai-responses","provider":"github-copilot","model":"gpt-5.2-codex","usage":{"input":767,"output":194,"cacheRead":67968,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":68929,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1770902359525}}
{"type":"message","id":"ef5c9e8a","parentId":"e6048ba0","timestamp":"2026-02-12T13:19:24.885Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_2rBRO4qecms9JfgMNSEPSQN7|","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"<?php\nnamespace SEOIndicator;\n\nabstract class Indicator {\n    protected string $name;\n\n    public function __construct(string $name) {\n        $this->name = $name;\n    }\n\n    public function getName(): string {\n        return $this->name;\n    }\n\n    abstract public function analyze(array $data): array;\n}\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1770902364882}}
{"type":"message","id":"5a9bc982","parentId":"ef5c9e8a","timestamp":"2026-02-12T13:19:27.131Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","thinkingSignature":"{\"encrypted_content\":\"\",\"id\":\"\",\"summary\":[],\"type\":\"reasoning\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_5N3z8lJKKl66HChcYDT3quo7|","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"C:\\Users\\Raitis\\Desktop\\My WEB projects\\SEOIndicator-com\\Files-SEOIndicator-com\\seo-guides\\UrlIndicator.php"},"partialJson":"{\"path\":\"C:\\\\Users\\\\Raitis\\\\Desktop\\\\My WEB projects\\\\SEOIndicator-com\\\\Files-SEOIndicator-com\\\\seo-guides\\\\UrlIndicator.php\"}"}],"api":"openai-responses","provider":"github-copilot","model":"gpt-5.2-codex","usage":{"input":267,"output":58,"cacheRead":68736,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":69061,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1770902364885}}
{"type":"message","id":"83f534e7","parentId":"5a9bc982","timestamp":"2026-02-12T13:19:27.161Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_5N3z8lJKKl66HChcYDT3quo7|","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"<?php\nnamespace SEOIndicator;\n\nuse SEOIndicator\\Indicator;\n\nclass UrlIndicator extends Indicator {\n    public function __construct() {\n        parent::__construct('URL Indicator');\n    }\n\n    public function analyze(array $data): array {\n        $urlData = $data['url'] ?? null;\n        if (!$urlData) {\n            return ['score' => 1, 'details' => 'No URL data', 'suggestion' => 'Provide valid URL data'];\n        }\n\n        $https = $urlData['https'] ? 1 : 0;\n        $domainLength = $urlData['domain_length'] <= 15 ? 1 : 0;\n        $score = $https + $domainLength + 1;\n\n        return [\n            'score' => min(3, $score),\n            'details' => $urlData['url'],\n            'suggestion' => $https ? 'Good URL' : 'Use HTTPS'\n        ];\n    }\n}\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1770902367158}}
{"type":"message","id":"6b9d5975","parentId":"83f534e7","timestamp":"2026-02-12T13:19:29.152Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Noting MetaDescriptionIndicator**","thinkingSignature":"{\"encrypted_content\":\"\",\"id\":\"\",\"summary\":[{\"text\":\"**Noting MetaDescriptionIndicator**\",\"type\":\"summary_text\"}],\"type\":\"reasoning\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_bhQ5KzzpGraUxec7qfD8HfuJ|","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"C:\\Users\\Raitis\\Desktop\\My WEB projects\\SEOIndicator-com\\Files-SEOIndicator-com\\seo-guides\\MetaDescriptionIndicator.php"},"partialJson":"{\"path\":\"C:\\\\Users\\\\Raitis\\\\Desktop\\\\My WEB projects\\\\SEOIndicator-com\\\\Files-SEOIndicator-com\\\\seo-guides\\\\MetaDescriptionIndicator.php\"}"}],"api":"openai-responses","provider":"github-copilot","model":"gpt-5.2-codex","usage":{"input":1043,"output":58,"cacheRead":68224,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":69325,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1770902367162}}
{"type":"message","id":"e2aae402","parentId":"6b9d5975","timestamp":"2026-02-12T13:19:29.183Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_bhQ5KzzpGraUxec7qfD8HfuJ|","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"<?php\nnamespace SEOIndicator;\n\nuse SEOIndicator\\Indicator;\n\nclass MetaDescriptionIndicator extends Indicator {\n    public function __construct() {\n        parent::__construct('Meta Description Indicator');\n    }\n\n    public function analyze(array $data): array {\n        $metaDescription = $data['meta_description'] ?? '';\n        $length = strlen($metaDescription);\n        \n        $score = ($length >= 120 && $length <= 160) ? 3 : 2;\n\n        return [\n            'score' => $score,\n            'details' => htmlspecialchars(substr($metaDescription, 0, 100)),\n            'suggestion' => 'Optimize the meta description to 120-160 characters'\n        ];\n    }\n}\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1770902369181}}
{"type":"message","id":"9f60dc1a","parentId":"e2aae402","timestamp":"2026-02-12T13:19:33.451Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Reviewing indicator implementation scope**\n\nOnly 2 of 19 indicator classes exist, so I'll check the old PHP scripts in the seo-guides folder to see if they contain relevant static analysis logic for the remaining indicators before proceeding.","thinkingSignature":"{\"encrypted_content\":\"\",\"id\":\"\",\"summary\":[{\"text\":\"**Reviewing indicator implementation scope**\\n\\nOnly 2 of 19 indicator classes exist, so I'll check the old PHP scripts in the seo-guides folder to see if they contain relevant static analysis logic for the remaining indicators before proceeding.\",\"type\":\"summary_text\"}],\"type\":\"reasoning\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_gj6RTZdbgcSxLxP3xgOmChQS|","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"C:\\Users\\Raitis\\Desktop\\My WEB projects\\SEOIndicator-com\\Files-SEOIndicator-com\\seo-guides\\title-tag.php","offset":1,"limit":60},"partialJson":"{\"path\":\"C:\\\\Users\\\\Raitis\\\\Desktop\\\\My WEB projects\\\\SEOIndicator-com\\\\Files-SEOIndicator-com\\\\seo-guides\\\\title-tag.php\",\"offset\":1,\"limit\":60}"}],"api":"openai-responses","provider":"github-copilot","model":"gpt-5.2-codex","usage":{"input":1253,"output":146,"cacheRead":68224,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":69623,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1770902369184}}
{"type":"message","id":"f4f0abf7","parentId":"9f60dc1a","timestamp":"2026-02-12T13:19:33.477Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_gj6RTZdbgcSxLxP3xgOmChQS|","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\" data-bs-theme=\"dark\">\n  <head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n    <title>SEOIndicator.com - Title Tag SEO Guide</title>\n    <link href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.6/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"../style.css\"> \n  </head>\n\n    <!-- Google tag (gtag.js) -->\n    <script async src=\"https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtag/js?id=G-RWCSLW7EXF\"></script>\n    <script>\n    window.dataLayer = window.dataLayer || [];\n    function gtag(){dataLayer.push(arguments);}\n    gtag('js', new Date());\n\n    gtag('config', 'G-RWCSLW7EXF');\n    </script>\n\n  <body class=\"results-view\">\n    \n    <!-- Contact Email Link in Top Right -->\n    <div class=\"position-fixed top-0 end-0 p-3\" style=\"z-index: 1050;\">\n        <a href=\"mailto:info@SEOIndicator.com\" class=\"text-white text-decoration-none\" style=\"transition: color 0.3s ease;\" title=\"Contact us\" onmouseover=\"this.style.color='#0d6efd'\" onmouseout=\"this.style.color='white'\">\n            info@SEOIndicator.com\n        </a>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-lg-10 col-md-12\"> \n                <div class=\"text-center mb-4\">\n                    <a href=\"/\">\n                        <img src=\"../Logo-SEOIndicator-com.png\" alt=\"SEOIndicator.com Logo\" style=\"max-width: 200px; margin-bottom: 20px;\"> \n                    </a>\n                    <h1 class=\"mb-4 main-title\">Title Tag SEO Guide</h1>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"card bg-dark border-secondary mb-4\">\n                    <div class=\"card-body\">\n                        <h2 class=\"card-title text-primary mb-3\">What is a Title Tag?</h2>\n                        <p class=\"card-text\">\n                            The title tag is an HTML element that specifies the title of a web page. It appears in the browser's title bar, search engine results pages (SERPs), and when sharing links on social media. The title tag is defined within the <code>&lt;head&gt;</code> section of your HTML document using the <code>&lt;title&gt;</code> element.\n                        </p>\n                        <div class=\"bg-secondary p-3 rounded mt-3\">\n                            <strong>HTML Example:</strong><br>\n                            <code>&lt;head&gt;<br>\n                            &nbsp;&nbsp;&lt;title&gt;Your Page Title Here&lt;/title&gt;<br>\n                            &lt;/head&gt;</code>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"card bg-dark border-secondary mb-4\">\n                    <div class=\"card-body\">\n                        <h2 class=\"card-title text-success mb-3\">Why Title Tags Matter for SEO</h2>\n                        <ul class=\"list-unstyled\">\n                            <li class=\"mb-2\">🔍 <strong>Search Engine Ranking:</strong> Title tags are one of the most important on-page SEO factors that search engines use to understand your page content</li>\n                            <li class=\"mb-2\">👁️ <strong>Click-Through Rate (CTR):</strong> Compelling titles in search results increase the likelihood users will click on your page</li>\n\n[137 more lines in file. Use offset=61 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1770902373474}}
